        "value": "社家　百八戸　人口　四百七十四人〔ママ〕　内"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Shinto priestly households (shake): 108 households, population 474 persons as printed. The printed total does not reconcile: the male and female sub-counts below are 236 and 263, which sum to 499. The reprint flags the figure — a small katakana マ (a sic mark, 27x16px, an isolated ink component) is printed beside 七 and a small dot beside the final 四, exactly the two digits that would each have to read 九 to give 499. Transcribed as printed."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "社家"
